    "body": "Source: 12. LECTURE NOTES - ENGLISH VOCABULARY.pdf\nSource type: pdf\n\nFickle - Changing\nJaunt - Trip\nLethargic - Sluggish\nNefarious - Wicked\nProfuse - Abundant\nRampant - Extensive\nSentry - Guard\nTacky - Shabby\nVerdant - Green\nWrath - rage\nGlib - Fluent\nCupidity - Greed\nParagon - Model\nWhim - Caprice\n\nProwess - Bravery\n\nHomage - Tribute\n\nANTONYMS: words which mean the opposite of\nanother.\n It is best to know the category under which the\nwords fall - whether positive or negative, and\npleasant or unpleasant.\nCOMMON ANTONYMS\nAbdicate - Accept\nAmeliorate - Worsen\nCowardice - Bravery\nDisdain - Respect\nGenial - Unwelcoming\nHail - Chide\nAcclaim - Admonish\nBoon - Disadvantage\nCunning - Simple\nExtol - Deprecate\nGenteel - Vulgar\nImbue - Empty\nAlleviate - Aggravate\nCastigate - Praise\nDeluge - Drought\nFlagrant - Veiled\nGrueling - Easy\nImperious - Subservient\nLaud - Decry\nMagnanimous - Stingy\nNebulous - Clear\nPious - Offensive\nTaciturn - Loyal\nWax - Wane\nLiberty - Captivity\nMitigate - Oppose\nPandemonium - Order\nSemblance - Difference\nTout - Disparage\nLugubrious - Ebullient\nMuddle - In order\nPanegyrize - Denigrate\nShackle - Encourage\nTranquil - Noisy\nPacify - Repel\nTout - Disparage\nPanegyrize - Denigrate\nMollify - Rebuff\nAllay - Incense\nDecorous - Irascible\nExtol - Censure\nHail - Chide\nPOSITIVE\nGENEROUS\nMunificent\nEffusive\nCharitable\nBeneficent\nBenevolent\nAltruistic\nHospitable\n\nMagnanimous\nPhilanthropic\nCOURAGEOUS\nValiant\nDauntless\nGallant\nAudacious\nStalwart\nIntrepid\nPLEASANT\nDecorous\nEngaging\nUnblemished\nCordial\nAffable\nAgreeable\nCongenial\nObliging\nSportive\nLIVELY\nBrisk\nInspiring\nProvocative\nDynamic\nEbullient\nRICH\nCopious\nMyriad\nPlentiful\nAffluent\nMultifarious\nOpulent\nProfuse\nPlethoric\nCAREFUL\nProvident\nCircumspect\nChary\nDiscreet\nExacting\nGingerly\nHeedful\nConscientious\n\nSkinflinty\nThrifty\nTIMID\nTimorous\nIndisposed\nLaconic\nDiffident\nReticent\nReserved\nUNPLEASANT\nIreful\nObstinate\nPetulant\nGruff\nCallous\nCaptious\nContentious\nPeevish\nPerverse\nBLEAK\nDejected\nMuted\nProstrate\nForlorn\nLackluster\nPOOR\nDestitute\nIndigent\nPaucity\nDearth\nImpecunious\nInsolvent\nScanty\nPenurious\nCARELESS\nReprehensible\nFelonious\nCulpable\nInsouciant\nLackadaisical\nNegligent\nPerfunctory\nIndifferent\n\nNEGATIVE\nCHEAP\nSpartan\nParsimonous\nPaltry\nMiserly\nNiggardly\nFrugal\nPenurios\n\nDR. CARL E. BALITA REVIEW CENTER TEL. NO. 735-4098/7350740\n\n-3-",
