    "source_type": "pdf",
    "source_path": "/Users/lyndon/All reviewers/-LET REVIEWER 2026/C. MAJOR SUBJECTS/A. ENGLISH/OTHER ESSENTIALS/4. STRUCTURES OF ENGLISH LANGUAGE.pdf",
